      "description": "Renders a point in time as relative ('2 hours ago'), absolute ('Apr 18, 2026, 14:32'), or combined. Use relative for recent events in activity feeds; absolute for records, logs, and audit trails where exact time matters; combined when both are needed (absolute in tooltip, relative in label). Size sm for dense tables; md for card metadata. Emphasis subtle for secondary metadata. Respect user locale and timezone — never hardcode format.",
