  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Timestamp",
    "Description",
    "Point in time displayed as relative, absolute, or combined. Pair with activity feeds, records, logs, and audit trails.",
    "Formats",
    "relative   '2 hours ago'. For recent activity feeds and live data.\nabsolute   'Apr 18, 2026, 14:32'. For records, logs, audits.\ncombined   Shows both — absolute in tooltip, relative in label.",
    "Sizes",
    "sm   Dense tables, audit log rows.\nmd   Card metadata, thread headers, default for activity feeds.",
    "Emphasis",
    "default   Primary timestamp — top of a thread or row.\nsubtle    Secondary metadata — 'Last edited' under a title.",
    "Labels & Content",
    "Always expose full absolute timestamp in the title attribute or tooltip.\nUse ISO 8601 for machine-readable output.\nRespect user locale and timezone — never hardcode the format.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Use relative for feeds, absolute for records\nDO   Expose full date/time in tooltip or title\nDO   Use the user's locale and timezone\nDO   Update relative timestamps in real time",
    "DON'T   Use relative for legal, financial, or audit records\nDON'T   Hardcode 'MM/DD/YYYY' or any single locale format\nDON'T   Show 'N days ago' past 30 days — switch to absolute\nDON'T   Assume server timezone matches user timezone"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
